{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "829d8cd2448e1107df7e3d590b739905b8738de93d997fc223e39d316063afca", "ja": "努力は誰がために", "zh": "努力为谁而作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d2f7a58ac3f2a45591c6bbe1d3d0fedb831496e4068fd2b879de76b1d76d845a", "ja": "真珠星は織姫の仕事用スマホからレッスン\n動画やメモを見つける。それを頼りに自主練\nしていると、なるに話しかけられる。気合い\nが入っている理由を「ムカついたから」と\n言う真珠星。無事、選抜合格を勝ち取る。", "zh": "真珠星从织姫工作用的手机里找到了练习\n视频和笔记。她依靠这些进行自主练习时，\nなる向她搭话。真珠星说自己之所以干劲十足，\n是“因为被惹火了”。最终顺利通过选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "2ca7fe9ff050e170043c0fa1f9e7af640075d69b9a06132bc6ea81d688db6c15", "ja": "悔しい～……！　お姉ちゃんがいないからって、\nあんなこと勝手に決めるなんて……！", "zh": "太不甘心了～……！就因为姐姐不在，竟然擅自决定那种事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "08d6349e25e06c2cd708a3b2fea0d6e2aa7eba9b699c38d4eecd83000cd3ce9d", "ja": "I.V.の半分は、お姉ちゃんの名前でしょ！\nあのふたりの勝手にはさせないんだから！", "zh": "I.V.的一半，明明就是姐姐的名字吧！\n我才不会任由那两个人胡来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "5e3f56ba7548c7a64552049cd6f28c25321e2415f845541ca1450143785d6644", "ja": "まずはバックダンサーの選抜に受からないと。\nでも今の私じゃ、正直……。", "zh": "首先必须通过伴舞的选拔才行。\n可是以我现在的水平，说实话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "737fb79bdab66cf3197d76991042000e84a52c2592f9a23df0798ec37663464f", "ja": "お姉ちゃんは、どうしてたのかな……。私って、\nお姉ちゃんの仕事のこと、何も知らないんだ……。", "zh": "姐姐当时是怎么做的呢……我啊，\n对姐姐的工作，什么都不了解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "e41f30b6644fbf226f49ac43a5f5551d8cc72ba2c7ac4f15da45a1c071e4cdc3", "ja": "あれ……？　でも、お姉ちゃんのお仕事用の\nスマホなら……確かまだ……！", "zh": "哎……？不过，如果是姐姐工作用的\n手机……我记得好像还在……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "f194ffb25cb61bd927a673158b7369c86099154b2973d593dca4adb75d2d4362", "ja": "これって、返さなくていいんだっけ……？\n……お姉ちゃん、ごめん！", "zh": "这个不用还回去也可以吧……？\n……姐姐，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "1b7be2e520041f4d08bc6c47886b802b8fdef7e9e16a652d9e1b208b3e694337", "ja": "！　レッスンの動画と、メモがたくさん……！\nロックかかってるところもあるけど……。", "zh": "啊！还有课程视频和好多笔记……！有些地方还锁着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "02cebc9657a07e49408b0897f1d288a0a9a01da05c79bef67752fbb252ff9b2c", "ja": "今は、これで十分！\nこれを全部、やるしかない……！", "zh": "现在，这些就足够了！\n只能把这些全部做完……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "7c9463a4dc70763eff0bf9c31819dd0095347538d644b3822192a77ad92e415d", "ja": "（翌日から、姉のメモを頼りにレッスンに打ち込んだ。\n出来ることすべて、自分の体に叩き込むために）", "zh": "（从第二天起，她便以姐姐的笔记为依据，投入到训练中。\n为了把自己能做到的一切，都彻底铭刻进身体里。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "4723c408a75dbf788cda27c7afd4d457bc35fabd711d823806ea258e475f3241", "ja": "あれ……？　今日のプログラムは終わったけど……\n真珠星さん、自主練……？", "zh": "咦……？今天的课程已经结束了，可是……真珠星小姐，你还要自主练习……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "e685298062add86e245d40088d1f502333cf39da30b8aeebd410bfd136e51fc6", "ja": "はあ、はあ……うん。\nバックダンサーの選抜、あるから……。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……嗯。\n因为要选拔伴舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "d3df699674639eb5692d27560f56f806f71d293de0fcaad2d80434a0ec77a5c9", "ja": "そうなんだ。\n気合い、入ってるんだね……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n干劲十足呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "deb733e9020e3ef247e2f16b091f528548d2db7bd54a5a4692c50fa6fbfdb1b5", "ja": "当たり前だよね……。\nお姉さんのユニットなんだから……。", "zh": "这也是理所当然的嘛……\n毕竟是姐姐的组合啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "e10d4f26e258273f883a74c74efd5b977f7d36c2a6b9336d355facc9e0c63e2c", "ja": "それもそうだけど……。\n一番は、私がムカついたからかな。", "zh": "话是这么说没错……\n但最主要的原因，还是我自己觉得不爽吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "746590a543aeeafd307ab205894146b1d994d09fa9419430e22f99c8b83ed75f", "ja": "む、ムカつく？", "zh": "生气，吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "7fed36be119665f367a7e9bb4c798cc177a44b39b525e527141d1def4444cf92", "ja": "お姉ちゃんが死んでから、なんか、\nいろんなことが勝手に決まっていって……。", "zh": "姐姐去世以后，总觉得各种事情都擅自决定好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "9f50ba3f3c229dfe47619e6d7a6dbee4533695b519bb8875b1800accb1669b5a", "ja": "そういうのに、ムカついてたんだよね。\nだから。", "zh": "就是因为那些事，我一直很生气。\n所以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "4b3ea9ebabc2128ed090fffefd13e4d98f0bc881cbdae3b33f4f4d098fbcad12", "ja": "……あ、あの！", "zh": "……那、那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "d1fdb773ff85123f2040c3cc8eebaf4c0fa7250729ea4727e46fb7524086606e", "ja": "私も……私も、受かりたいの！　バックダンサー！\nだから……一緒に、練習してもいい？", "zh": "我也……我也想通过选拔！成为伴舞！所以……我可以和你一起练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "dfda02739b3aae9991b97a96bf53eeb8fc29fe7545d681490a5d52642f7297f4", "ja": "……。\nあの、それじゃあ……。", "zh": "……。\n那个，那么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "9eb55616d6ad7c8f1de414327c4f9c95c42c530e525ba8fd64d7bf9462162cdb", "ja": "ひとりじゃできないところがあって……。\n手伝ってもらってもいい？", "zh": "有些地方我一个人做不到……可以请你帮忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed5c9644dc7f62269e871f0fd8af2d6e6415aa8e6df3a50a5dcaa01be4007517", "ja": "うん、もちろん！", "zh": "嗯，当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "b9158d3b4629fa245730b34b94d6d8c209906b72ea8d91a76654953968c6a8b1", "ja": "バックダンサーの選抜試験について、\n一週間後に行うことが決まったわ。", "zh": "关于伴舞选拔考试，已经决定在一周后举行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "d6e4b45d99a71bc78c3d3f1dc29638e225f99f477299fbd0f7ab290a4810abd6", "ja": "当然、藍も審査に加わる。\n各自課題曲を聴き込み、全力で臨みなさい。", "zh": "蓝当然也会参与审查。\n各自仔细听好课题曲，全力以赴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1025_traineetachi", "source_sha256": "807467320df127a8459030448fa27de721f2a02bac19e3d425e3f657a45c00dd", "ja": "はい！！", "zh": "好的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "2c8890505d45cb1ee59ee2d5b6f4bf6c12e3972ef3520bf677bd910d6809c7a9", "ja": "一週間後……。\n思ったより、短いかも……。", "zh": "一周后……  \n可能比想象中还要短……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "42067a4129d5c46ba85f2294c6698b8ef65e9e0f00776b587927484b757b80b1", "ja": "……。\n上等じゃん。", "zh": "……。\n来就来呗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "12e71edc970b095d23d682aab6d52110f2fa3bc45cef8dca0d72e4bbf784b594", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……。\nあっ……！", "zh": "一、二、三、四……  \n啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "02cb16cf5adf62b5792b838d032439606cbfc7b2c5fc9529e405d4593dbe4188", "ja": "真珠星さん！　だ、大丈夫？\n今日はもう終わりにして、帰ったほうが……。", "zh": "真珠星！没、没事吧？\n今天就先到这里，你还是回去比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "275fe3af5438b1a105776d418e428c085dd2bc15d7d01c1ccb80c9915fce1adb", "ja": "……。\nなるさん、先に帰ってていいよ。", "zh": "……\n鸣小姐，你先回去也没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "b91a7be3f0f126bd9ff7f099776e39962c294845ce17d361aefe6dcb521dc732", "ja": "でも、無理するのは体にも……。", "zh": "可是，勉强自己也会对身体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "8023f1971c4195e72c6582f06ad7716f065e89fbac914b8a177cbe79a1c5d44e", "ja": "私なら大丈夫。\nあんまり遅くなると、家の人が心配するよ？", "zh": "我的话没问题。\n要是回去太晚，家里人会担心的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "cf6095e083905e27a3afd1efaeebe18d24a541a6ff6c05cc2bc53e9b28bfbf3c", "ja": "……わかった。\nいつもの塩飴とテーピング、置いとくね？", "zh": "……我知道了。\n平常用的盐糖和胶带，我放在这里了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "e85ea0ac145ef31f51c550717db9529fe74f9f2d257f9af604d33ea2e56ffed6", "ja": "ありがとう！\n……よし、もう一本……！", "zh": "谢谢！\n……好，再来一遍……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "6746b27afed2a657e21cc7cc5ad52846ae0c373dd98e028171291e0e1b7c7227", "ja": "（そして、バックダンサー選抜試験当日。\n私は、それまでの練習の成果を思いきりぶつけた）", "zh": "（然后，到了伴舞选拔考试当天。我将这段时间以来练习的成果，尽情展现了出来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac85d41e7690ed8e67fc946930e99cd9024869372f8cc6f102332ceed8b40dd1", "ja": "（驚いた藍の顔を見られたのは、\nちょっとだけ気持ちよかったかもしれない）", "zh": "（能看到蓝那副惊讶的表情，或许还真让我稍微有点痛快。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "525141fe873f2e41e4d0dc55cb7e9b5a37428e4ac42d5e031758f89b4c87d82e", "ja": "審査は以上ね。全体的にレベル高く\n仕上げてきてくれて、なによりだわ。", "zh": "审查就到这里吧。大家都完成得很出色，\n整体水平相当高，真是再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1038_039kon", "source_sha256": "9cfcf1f825063138337ede474ee78116181dc319241481c5bee467c15e37a50e", "ja": "藍の目から見て、どうかしら？\nおそらく、私と同じ意見だと思うけど。", "zh": "从藍的角度看，觉得怎么样？我想大概会和我的意见一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "533ba90bcfba1c6c41d51f85fd5234291ce080be08d7a006585b6e7b56322472", "ja": "そうね。合格者の発表の前に……\n7番、一宮真珠星。", "zh": "是啊。在公布合格者之前……\n第7号，一宫真珠星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "995d5e18391bf71a52105e8c6dd33ec9c20ace41118772eade5ce7fe29e3f1b8", "ja": "！\nはい。", "zh": "！是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1041_031tom", "source_sha256": "2ee94ed4afc1e217528a22da9aa3a66d3fc2fdea27e0fb92adce3f320333ae38", "ja": "まず、粗削りね。精度に関して言うなら\n他の子には及ばない点がちらほらあるわ。", "zh": "首先，还很粗糙呢。要说精度的话，\n也有不少比不上其他孩子的地方哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "bf9ad4d1b118012465f048e6bd508aa3f8ac3d44f0cd36fe20a73757cba37d53", "ja": "だけど、目を惹かれたわ。\nこの中で、誰よりも華があった。", "zh": "但是，很吸引我的目光。\n在这些人中，你比谁都更有光彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "2cd2f3cf68a6f6ba2b583e8d2d09940fbae70c3f59278fd9052628ddd868252d", "ja": "率直に聞くけど……。\nあなた、どんな魔法を使ったの？", "zh": "我就直说了……你到底用了什么魔法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1044_022ser", "source_sha256": "93ed60ea9d16e28f05416615113bacd87ce0dda0cc251ea9d13c3870893360f6", "ja": "魔法なんかじゃない、ただの特訓。\nお姉ちゃんの残した動画やメモを元にしただけ。", "zh": "不是魔法，只是特训。只是以姐姐留下的视频和笔记为基础而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1045_031tom", "source_sha256": "b7e4f827dfdff8200047ba6de7a91795df8da841e57b7811d16acf72fbd75669", "ja": "なら練習メニューは優秀かもね。\nけど、それくらいの事で……。", "zh": "那么训练菜单说不定还挺优秀的。\n不过，仅凭这种程度的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "c117fe1d043a62168ea80c6daad2b188df3139b9cec714ee938a7e014c32c9f1", "ja": "うまくいくわけないよね。\n私も最初、追いつくわけがないって思った。", "zh": "不可能顺利进行的吧。我一开始也觉得，自己不可能追得上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1047_022ser", "source_sha256": "3c51310a5b774caca3a4b6f2870a74e5af099d86c9e4550a3c5c9afdec90c7ae", "ja": "だから、全部書いてある事の3倍やった。\n時間も才能もないなら、無茶するしかないから。", "zh": "所以，我把写下来的所有事情都做了3倍。  \n既没有时间，也没有才能，就只能拼命乱来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "e6058aa5695949f8b2239bd1a313da2f8a9b817490ac6cea95548d44e28396a3", "ja": "ふふっ……。", "zh": "呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1049_022ser", "source_sha256": "9417e90d35dad8f63ab425bfda0aa85459ba7f9145adfb0e103b566d158a361e", "ja": "（笑った……。\n笑うことあるんだ、この人……）", "zh": "笑了……原来这个人也会笑啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1050_031tom", "source_sha256": "a3cb0788c43d755ccf3915c8fd5e47ede223dc55b53e2ffb5a6f09ab3c16648a", "ja": "アンタ、織姫と同じこと言ってる。\n……合格ね。", "zh": "你说了和织姬一样的话。\n……合格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1051_031tom", "source_sha256": "11bd96af4e926001c131a5806d3f7bffcb434f692b5d560ffe35cf9a9ddacc0a", "ja": "真珠星と息が合っていた、隣の8番も。\n次の舞台でバックダンサーとして立ってもらう。", "zh": "与真珠星配合默契的旁边那位8号也合格。下一场舞台就由你作为伴舞登台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1052_039kon", "source_sha256": "834d84a1b31d0a6af5e385a0bbf560abf6110d265af9882e7e93e357d63187be", "ja": "それ以外の合格者については、私から発表します。\n14番、31番……。", "zh": "至于其他通过者，就由我来宣布。\n14号、31号……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1053_023aka", "source_sha256": "b7b0e4147d1e11c1ae7d79a9c0c79e3773a0cba14caa6cfbb9cade638741fa89", "ja": "わっ、私も……？\nや、やった！！　やったね、真珠星さん！", "zh": "哇、我也……？\n太、太好了！！太好了呢，真珠星小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1054_022ser", "source_sha256": "a3aa9f6c37aa1413d8de88df0bd8b38ea8f4c571a2f34c6414ec049993957937", "ja": "う、うん。\n私、本当にやれたんだ……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n我真的做到了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1055_022ser", "source_sha256": "a52c9543b676d71cc5b261ea76dcbb15f135048c50ed201d712521b0e28164de", "ja": "これが私の第一歩。\nアイドル一宮真珠星の始まり。", "zh": "这就是我的第一步。  \n偶像一宫真珠星的起点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0333_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_05_1056_022ser", "source_sha256": "914a3becb4350c7dc6a2fc4bf8ad165a82df54b60efe13de06b8a3bc69eb1320", "ja": "どんな運命が自分を待ち受けているかも知らずに、\n私はこの世界へと足を踏み入れたのだ。", "zh": "还不知道等待着自己的将会是怎样的命运，\n我就这样踏入了这个世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
